  Mode: 76
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Waystation Prototype
  Description: 'Tiger Moths only - a prototype of Waystation. Weave each cluster, then climb down the
    Drop Tower to the next: short hops through floor plates, each ring just past its plate.
    Tap too short and you land on the plate; hold too long and the pipe ahead meets you
    before the Drop is back. Plates are mostly plain at low intensity, more of them danger
    as it climbs. The last gap is one long drop, and it leaves a wormhole for whoever
    follows.'
